  "id": "experiential-history",
  "term": "experiential history",
  "definition": "Experiential history is a person’s accumulated record of subjective experience, into which processed and interpreted bodily information becomes integrated. In this context, it refers to the personal background of felt and meaningful experiences that helps shape how sensory information is understood.",
